    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life changes every single day. It's important that no matter how much life changes, you appreciate it all the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about exploring the world and land of the people who own it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who are known as Meeples. You learn about who they are and what they do as </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you explore the colony of rooms that they have created together. While also</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learning about the world beyond, and what built the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Almost No Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > That One Guy With a Top Hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Learning Meeple's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sort-Of Story</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life changes every single day. It's important that no matter how much life changes, you appreciate it all the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about exploring the world and land of the people who own it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who are known as Meeples. You learn about who they are and what they do as </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you explore the colony of rooms that they have created together. While also</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learning about the world beyond, and what built the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Almost No Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > That One Guy With a Top Hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Learning Meeple's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sort-Of Story</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This game is not normal. It has no traditional gameplay loop or world format. In the game, you walk through a room. Each one is just as different as the last. You learn about the people who inhabit the world, known as Meeples, and you learn about the dark secret behind the world.",
